    "laboratory": [
      "Normal routine blood tests; metabolic screening typically unremarkable"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "Brain MRI showing classical lissencephaly with agyria and pachygyria",
      "Possible ventricular enlargement and corpus callosum hypoplasia",
